---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const checks = [
  { title: 'Service availability', copy: 'Confirm that the provider and membership are active before showing a current review or outbound link.' },
  { title: 'Settled record', copy: 'Record the source, period, number of tips, staking method and losing runs. Show dated figures only with methodology and caveats.' },
  { title: 'Achievable odds', copy: 'Test whether a subscriber can actually obtain the advised prices, allowing for timing and bookmaker limits.' },
  { title: 'Cost and delivery', copy: 'Verify current price, billing, cancellation, delivery time and support using the provider’s official terms.' },
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Paid tipster service review — pilot" wide={true}>
  <article class="service-review">
    <nav class="sr-crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/pilot/home/">EveryTip</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/pilot/winning-football-tipsters/">Paid tipsters</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><span>Service review</span></nav>
    <header class="sr-hero"><div><p class="kicker">Subscription-service review · design pilot</p><h1>A paid tipster service, reviewed</h1><p>A separate review framework for subscription tips. It puts service status, independent evidence, achievable prices and the real cost ahead of any sign-up prompt.</p><div class="sr-meta"><span>1 October 2026 design snapshot</span><span>No provider endorsed</span><span>No active affiliate link</span></div></div><aside><strong>Verdict pending</strong><p>A review cannot be current until the provider, product and record have been checked again.</p></aside></header>
    <p class="sr-alert"><strong>Legacy-content guardrail.</strong> Older EveryTip tipster reviews mention providers, prices and returns that may no longer apply. Do not carry over a profit claim or trial offer from a Beaver/Thrive block simply because its HTML survives migration.</p>
    <nav class="sr-jump" aria-label="On this review"><a href="#service-status">Status</a><a href="#service-checks">Review checks</a><a href="#service-method">Evidence</a><a href="#service-decision">Verdict</a></nav>
    <section id="service-status"><p class="kicker">Before anything else</p><h2>Is this service still available?</h2><div class="sr-status"><div><span>Provider</span><strong>Verified name required</strong></div><div><span>Membership</span><strong>Availability check required</strong></div><div><span>Last tested</span><strong>Dated editorial field</strong></div><div><span>Affiliate relation</span><strong>Optional, never assumed</strong></div></div></section>
    <section id="service-checks"><p class="kicker">What matters to readers</p><h2>Four checks in every service review</h2><div class="sr-checks">{checks.map((check, index) => <article><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><h3>{check.title}</h3><p>{check.copy}</p></article>)}</div></section>
    <section id="service-method"><p class="kicker">Transparent evidence</p><h2>Show the record behind the conclusion</h2><p>WordPress owns the editor’s assessment and method. A service record holds provider identity, status and date-checked fields. Any performance snapshot should retain its source URL, calculation method, period, prices and fees, and must never appear as a promise of future returns.</p><aside><strong>Evidence slot</strong><p>Result chart or sampled tips only after source, permission, date and methodology are verified. The layout supports a chart caption and a text alternative.</p></aside></section>
    <section id="service-decision"><p class="kicker">Editorial decision</p><h2>Who might it fit—and who should pass?</h2><div class="sr-decision"><div><h3>Potential fit</h3><p>A specific, evidence-backed audience and use case belongs here if the service is active.</p></div><div><h3>Reasons to pause</h3><p>Fees, bank requirements, possible losing runs, price movement and unavailable operators need equal prominence.</p></div></div><p>No membership CTA appears in this pilot. If a live service later qualifies, its link and commercial disclosure come from the approved central record.</p></section>
    <footer class="sr-footer">This is a neutral template preview, not a tipster recommendation. Past performance is not a guarantee of future results. 18+ · Gamble responsibly.</footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .service-review{color:#263d4f}.sr-crumb{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px;color:#607d8e;font-size:12px}.sr-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 215px;gap:21px;padding:26px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#e9f3fa,#fff);border-top:5px solid var(--et-orange)}.sr-hero h1{margin:3px 0 10px}.sr-hero>div>p:not(.kicker){max-width:710px;font-size:17px}.sr-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:17px}.sr-meta span{background:#fff;padding:6px 9px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#55758a}.sr-hero aside{display:grid;align-content:center;gap:8px;padding:17px;background:#fff;border-top:4px solid var(--et-blue)}.sr-hero aside strong{font-size:20px;color:#1d527c}.sr-hero aside p{margin:0;font-size:12px}.sr-alert{margin:15px 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff4e8;border-left:4px solid var(--et-orange);font-size:12px}.sr-jump{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;padding:9px 0 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #dce6ec}.sr-jump a{padding:7px 10px;background:#eaf3f9;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.service-review section{margin-top:32px;scroll-margin-top:20px}.service-review section h2{margin:3px 0 12px}.service-review section>p:not(.kicker){max-width:760px;line-height:1.6}.sr-status{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:9px}.sr-status div{display:grid;gap:6px;padding:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe8ef}.sr-status span{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800;color:#a8530d}.sr-status strong{font-size:13px;color:#244f6d}.sr-checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:11px}.sr-checks article{padding:17px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe8ef;border-top:4px solid var(--et-blue)}.sr-checks article>span{font-size:11px;font-weight:850;color:#ac5405}.sr-checks h3{margin:7px 0}.sr-checks p{margin:0;font-size:13px}.service-review section>aside{max-width:650px;padding:17px;background:#eaf3f9;border-left:4px solid var(--et-blue)}.service-review section>aside p{margin:5px 0 0;font-size:13px}.sr-decision{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}.sr-decision>div{padding:18px;background:#eaf3f9}.sr-decision>div:last-child{background:#fff4e8}.sr-decision h3{margin:0 0 7px}.sr-decision p{margin:0;font-size:13px}.sr-footer{border-top:1px solid #dce6ec;margin-top:33px;padding:14px 0;color:#617a8b;font-size:11px}@media(max-width:700px){.sr-hero,.sr-checks,.sr-decision{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sr-hero{padding:20px 15px}.sr-hero>div>p:not(.kicker){font-size:15px}.sr-status{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:440px){.sr-status{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
